<h3><u>Chin gayi sar se rida</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p>aal-e-muhammad pe aafat ki ghadi hai<br />
bhaiya teri behna sar nange khadi hai<br />
nalao-shewan se ek hashr bapa hai<br />
koi na waris raha khaima har ek jal gaya<br />
chin gayi sar se rida karti thi zainab buka</p>

<p>uthne lage khaimo se aag ke sholay<br />
kaise teri behna bachcho ko sambhale<br />
ghash mein mera abid sholo may ghira hai<br />
chin gayi sar se ...</p>

<p>haye ali akbar tum kyon nahi aaye<br />
zaalimon ne aakay sab khaimay jalaye<br />
kaun kare nusrat koi na raha hai<br />
chin gayi sar se ...</p>

<p>cheen liye kaano se shimr ne gauhar<br />
kisse kare shikwa baba na biradar<br />
khoon sakina ke kaano se baha hai<br />
chin gayi sar se ...</p>

<p>aag ne daaman ko jab uske jalaya<br />
bali sakina ne ro-ro ke sunaya<br />
dasht-e-bayaba hai aur karbobala hai<br />
chin gayi sar se ...</p>

<p>maut ke sehra mein gham khurda hirasaa<br />
dhoondti hai bachchi har simt pareshaa<br />
lab pe fakhat baba baba ki sada hai<br />
chin gayi sar se ...</p>

<p>makhtal mein goonji aawaz-e-bunayya<br />
yun na karo naale-aelaiyya<br />
door hai darya bhi aur khooni fiza hai<br />
chin gayi sar se ...</p>

<p>tere chacha ko hai is waqt aziyyat<br />
jao na dariya pe gar hai koi ulfat<br />
mujse kaho beta jo unse gila hai<br />
chin gayi sar se ...</p>

<p>teri phuphi beta sehra-e-bala may<br />
dhoondti hai tumko woh girdo-newa may<br />
teri judai se masroof-e-buka hai<br />
chin gayi sar se ...</p>

<p>sunke anees-e-gham ye nauha iram may<br />
hoor-o-malak naale karne lage gham may<br />
majlis-e-sarwar may kohraam bapa hai<br />
chin gayi sar se ...</p>
</p>